(text "USBKA  |  CBM-II USB keyboard adapter" (at 12.7 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid bcb34f4b-c337-5490-a517-b3ec255d25a8))
(text "B128/B256 High-Profile keyboard port  •  Arduino Mega 2560 + MT8816AE1 + Mustpoint CH9350L" (at 12.7 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.44 1.44)) (justify left)) (uuid fd5d06b6-4992-58b2-b147-05537d687056))
(text "Mega is powered via USB; its 5V pin supplies the adapter." (at 12.7 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid 6f4e65d7-f407-5d0c-bc19-ea8fd260611d))
(text "Keyboard plugs into the Mustpoint module’s USB-A socket." (at 12.7 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid d1c18114-90a7-5a40-b822-a4b97dfaf266))
(text "115200 baud • S0, S1, BA0, BA1 and SEL all set to 1." (at 12.7 143.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.17 1.17)) (justify left)) (uuid edbc0649-dd76-5b18-b8d8-a5f914ad5af7))
(text "RESET pull-up and MT8816 bypass" (at 12.7 151.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.42 1.42) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid 029b802b-08c6-563d-a76b-f689187d11c1))
(text "Place C1 close to U1 pin 40 (VDD), with a short ground return." (at 12.7 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.18 1.18)) (justify left)) (uuid bef6ebf3-f2e0-57da-bbcb-f957a4691f75))
(text "D40 shares Y5 / PC5 for USBKAV; USBKA leaves it as an input without pull-up." (at 12.7 184.15 0) (effects (font (size 1.18 1.18)) (justify left)) (uuid 5a6a5c28-97ed-5414-bdc6-bf0dbd2421ca))
(text "Connect or disconnect DB25 with both units off. Power USBKA on first; CBM-II off first." (at 12.7 187.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.18 1.18)) (justify left)) (uuid e9294dd5-9c25-544b-8de6-8594d9079e97))
(text "Use the molded pin numbers on the DB25 plug." (at 12.7 191.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid e1bde256-d901-5669-8fd2-b6d49036758e))
